From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pschatzmann <phil.schatzmann@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:05:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] v4l2: drop stale comment saying USERPTR is unsupported

USERPTR is advertised again since buffers that start inside a page
are supported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 fthd_v4l2.c | 3 ---
 1 file changed, 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/fthd_v4l2.c b/fthd_v4l2.c
index 1904ba3..7e42255 100644
--- a/fthd_v4l2.c
+++ b/fthd_v4l2.c
@@ -762,9 +762,6 @@ int fthd_v4l2_register(struct fthd_private *dev_priv)
 
 	q = &dev_priv->vb2_queue;
 	q->type = V4L2_BUF_TYPE_VIDEO_CAPTURE;
-	/* VB2_USERPTR not supported due to missing support for unaligned
-	 * pointers.
-	 */
 	q->io_modes = VB2_MMAP | VB2_USERPTR | VB2_DMABUF | VB2_READ;
 	q->drv_priv = dev_priv;
 	q->ops = &vb2_queue_ops;
-- 
2.56.0

